    {
      "id": 0,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Honesty caveat -- read before citing any MTTA/MTTR figure from this dashboard.",
      "options": {
        "content": "**Real caveat, stated up front, not discovered during use**: MTTA/MTTR are meaningless in mock-simulator mode unless someone is actually clicking Acknowledge/Resolve on the [Alarm Console](/d/ims-ldi-alarm-console) regularly. As of this dashboard's build (2026-08-15), `public.ldi_alarm_lifecycle` spans ~2 days and 782 rows -- **every single one is still status `OPEN`**. Zero rows have ever been acknowledged or resolved. Every MTTA/MTTR panel below will show `NO_DATA` until real operator interaction happens -- that's an honest reflection of current usage, not a broken dashboard. The one panel with real signal today is the bottom triage table, which shows currently-open alarms by how long they've been waiting.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "◉ MTTA (Acknowledge, 24h)",
      "description": "Mean time to acknowledge, last 24 hours. AVG(acknowledged_at - logdate) over rows where acknowledged_at is set.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "timescaledb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "timescaledb"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "/* NO_TIMEFILTER_INTENTIONAL: 24h window is expressed in the WHERE clause itself, not a dashboard time-range dependency */\nSELECT ROUND((EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM AVG(acknowledged_at - logdate)) / 60)::NUMERIC, 1) AS value\nFROM public.ldi_alarm_lifecycle\nWHERE acknowledged_at IS NOT NULL\n  AND logdate > NOW() - INTERVAL '24 hours';",
          "refId": "A",
          "sql": {
            "columns": [],
            "groupBy": [],
            "limit": 50
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "m",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#22C55E",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#F59E0B",
                "value": 15
              },
              {
                "color": "#EF4444",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "color": "#64748B",
                  "text": "NO_DATA",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
